{"description":"急上昇(総合100, 音楽50, ゲーム50, 映画とアニメ100)","items":[{"category_id":"10","channel_id":"UCwjAKjycHHT1QzHrQN5Stww","channel_title":"SixTONES","description":"▼「マイオンリー」各ストリーミングサービスにて配信中\nhttps:\/\/sixtones.lnk.to\/MyOnly\n\n「マイオンリー」\n“愛してる forever”というキラーワードが耳に残る真っ直ぐに相手を愛し続ける一途な想いを歌ったラブソング。\n\n夜のクロアチアを舞台に撮影された本作。静寂に包まれた夜空へ、たったひとりへの変わらない想いを届ける切なくも美しい映像作品。\n\nSixTONES\n18th シングル「Dance Forever\/マイオンリー」\n2026.9.9 Release\n\n-\nDirected by Daichi Yasuda (P.I.C.S.)\nChoreographer: IPPATSU\n-\n\n「My Only」\nFilmed at night in Croatia, this music video tells a beautiful yet bittersweet story of sending unwavering feelings into the silent night sky for the one you love.\n\n#SixTONES_マイオンリー #SixTONES_DanceForever #SixTONES\n\n▶SixTONES 18th シングル「Dance Forever\/マイオンリー」DISCOGRAPHY\nhttps:\/\/www.sixtones.jp\/discography\/d030\/\n\n▶SixTONES Streaming & Download\nhttps:\/\/SixTONES.lnk.to\/ArtistAY\n\n▶SixTONES Official web site\nhttps:\/\/www.sixtones.jp\/ \n\n▶SixTONES ソニーミュージック公式X(旧Twitter)\nhttps:\/\/twitter.com\/SixTONES_SME \n\n▶SixTONES ソニーミュージック公式TikTok\nhttps:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@sixtones_sme \n\n▶︎Subscribe SixTONES YouTube Channel\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@SixTONES_official \n\n▶︎Music Contents\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/playlist?list=PLqiG_x2P16Ovxcyk9NbkRI-oPKSXtWmvq\n\n▶︎Instagram\nhttps:\/\/www.instagram.com\/sixtones_official\/\n\n▶︎STARTO ENTERTAINMENT Official Site\nhttps:\/\/starto.jp\/sixtones\/","duration":240,"like_count":70142,"published_at":"2026-07-17T10:00:06Z","thumbnail":{"height":180,"url":"https:\/\/i.ytimg.com\/vi\/3lOsboT-IWU\/mqdefault.jpg","width":320},"title":"SixTONES – マイオンリー","url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=3lOsboT-IWU","video_id":"3lOsboT-IWU","view_count":6878871},{"category_id":"22","channel_id":"UCUg4VK-pSbpWfebcRI5wb-Q","channel_title":"素敵な小話","description":"","duration":61,"like_count":111913,"published_at":"2026-07-06T11:30:29Z","thumbnail":{"height":180,"url":"https:\/\/i.ytimg.com\/vi\/FJGLN8B97Ws\/mqdefault.jpg","wi