port. \nTo help everyone enjoy the stream more, please follow these rules:\n\n1.Be nice to other viewers. Don’t spam or troll \n2.If you see spam or trolling, don’t respond. Just block, report, and ignore.\n3.Talk about the stream, but please don’t bring up unrelated topics or have personal conversations.\n4.Don’t bring up other streamers or streams unless I mention them.\n5.Similarly, don’t talk about me or my stream in other streamers’ chat.\n6.Please refrain from chatting before the stream starts to prevent any issues\nAs long as you follow the rules above, you can chat in any language\n\n--------------------------------\n※ホロライブプロダクションから未成年の視聴者の方々へのお願い\n[カバー 未成年者の方々へ]で検索してお読みいただくか、\n下記リンクをご確認の上、お楽しみください。\nhttps:\/\/hololivepro.com\/request-to-minors\/\n--------------------------------","duration":7327,"like_count":5435,"published_at":"2026-07-20T15:06:39Z","thumbnail":{"height":180,"url":"https:\/\/i.ytimg.com\/vi\/hkJ-t0wlAHM\/mqdefault.jpg","width":320},"title":"【めっちゃカメレオン】めっちゃ画伯が集合したカメレオン【獅白ぼたん\/ホロライブ】","url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=hkJ-t0wlAHM","video_id":"hkJ-t0wlAHM","view_count":63060},{"category_id":"20","channel_id":"UCqy8AfibWWLtlIvuIbRHOTA","channel_title":"チョー(ぶいすぽ切り抜き)","description":"▼元動画▼\n【 VCR RUST3 】　はじめてのRUSTいくぞおおおお\ud83c\udff4‍☠️！！！！！！　【 ぶいすぽっ！ ⁠\/蝶屋はなび 】\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=VeRFLmG21GM\n\n▼出演配信者様▼\n@HanabiChoya  \n@MilanKestrel \n@KagaSumire \n@nazunakaga \n@uruhaichinose \n@963Noah \n@hinanotachiba7 \n@shiranamiramune \n\n0:00 ミランのトラブルシューティング\n5:34 パニックはなびの面倒をみてくれるひなーの\n11:23 先輩への害は許さない\n\n▼OP元動画▼\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=L-Zt53vDMng\n\n▼使わせていただいた効果音の引用元▼\n音OtoLogic様 https:\/\/otologic.jp\/free\/se\/parody-accent01.html\n効果音ラボ様 https:\/\/soundeffect-lab.info\/sound\/anime\/\n\n▼使わせていただいたBGMの引用元▼\nhttps:\/\/dova-s.jp\/\nhttps:\/\/musmus.main.jp\nhttps:\/\/kyattoworks.com\/category\/freebgm\/\n @noiseless_world   \n\n\n▼使わせていただいた素材の引用元▼\nhttps:\/\/miirriin.com\/\nhttps:\/\/f-stock.net\/\nhttps:\/\/penta-d